---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Astrophysics Cosmology Cheat Sheet | Free Big Bang, Expansion, Fate"
  description="Complete astrophysics cosmology cheat sheet with Big Bang, expansion, and fate of universe. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Astrophysics Cosmology<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Big Bang, expansion, and fate of universe. From origin to ultimate destiny.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Big Bang</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Key Events</h3>
        <pre><code>t = 0: Singularity
t = 10⁻⁴³ s: Planck epoch
t = 10⁻³⁶ s: Inflation
t = 3 min: Nucleosynthesis
t = 380,000 yr: Recombination (CMB)
t = 200 Myr: First stars
t = 13.8 Gyr: Today</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Evidence</h3>
        <pre><code>CMB: 2.725 K blackbody
Hubble expansion: v = H₀d
Primordial abundances: H, He, Li
Large-scale structure formation</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Expansion</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Hubble's Law</h3>
        <pre><code>v = H₀d
H₀ = 70 km/s/Mpc
Age: t₀ ≈ 1/H₀ ≈ 14 Gyr
Scale factor: a(t) = R(t)/R(t₀)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Deceleration</h3>
        <pre><code>q₀ = -R̈R/Ṙ²
q₀ > 0: decelerating (matter dominated)
q₀ < 0: accelerating (dark energy)
Observation: q₀ < 0 (accelerating)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Composition</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Energy Budget</h3>
        <pre><code>Dark energy: 68%
Dark matter: 27%
Ordinary matter: 5%
Radiation: < 0.01%</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Fate of Universe</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Scenarios</h3>
        <pre><code>Big Freeze: dark energy dominates
Big Crunch: gravity reverses expansion
Big Rip: dark energy destroys everything
Big Bounce: cyclic model</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
